From: pom11 <parsecoriginalmastercraft@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 02:10:02 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat(kanban): pure review-pairing transform for decompose

Add _pair_review_tasks: a pure transform that appends a reviewer task for
each impl child whose assignee is in kanban.auto_review.review_roles, gated
behind its impl child via parents=[impl_index]. No-op for empty policy.

Includes the full tests/test_kanban_review_pairing.py (all pairing + policy
tests folded into the single re-created file per the re-carry task).

[re-carry c67ebf0c / part of 09e1357f73 onto v2026.9.11]
---
 hermes_cli/kanban_decompose.py      | 39 ++++++++++++++
 tests/test_kanban_review_pairing.py | 84 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 123 insertions(+)
